                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d1f6e15f-7969-44fe-9af9-785a91d39f03",
                        "source_entry_id": "811516e9-7724-385d-ace9-12bbac653dd3",
                        "source_sense_id": "e8590ede-f9c9-3d39-9427-ce07efb07508",
                        "target_lang_word": "profit",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "profit",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a1a5220-a2fa-31c4-a0f1-bd9ae3d18f9d",
                                        "entry_id": "ba5bd138-66de-3752-b024-b25ff915f061",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Total income or cash flow minus expenditures. The money or other benefit a non-governmental organization or individual receives in exchange for products and services sold at an advertised price."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "864e75ed-056d-4ebb-91a8-f971e44bca34",
                                                "sense_id": "1a1a5220-a2fa-31c4-a0f1-bd9ae3d18f9d",
                                                "text": "Let no man anticipate uncertain profits."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a01aa129-aafb-43a4-9cad-4d4581fc38d3",
                                                "sense_id": "1a1a5220-a2fa-31c4-a0f1-bd9ae3d18f9d",
                                                "text": "War is a racket. It always has been. It is possibly the oldest, easily the most profitable, surely the most vicious. It is the only one international in scope. It is the only one in which the profits are reckoned in dollars and the losses in lives... Of course, it isn't put that crudely in war time. It is dressed into speeches about patriotism, love of country, and \"we must all put our shoulders to the wheel,\" but the profits jump and leap and skyrocket—and are safely pocketed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89e585ad-7787-43ac-9732-4a0a2b873955",
                                                "sense_id": "1a1a5220-a2fa-31c4-a0f1-bd9ae3d18f9d",
                                                "text": "The ability to shift profits to low-tax countries by locating intellectual property in them, which is then licensed to related businesses in high-tax countries, is often assumed to be the preserve of high-tech companies. […] current tax rules make it easy for all sorts of firms to generate […] “stateless income”: profit subject to tax in a jurisdiction that is neither the location of the factors of production that generate the income nor where the parent firm is domiciled."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8df9670e-d1e3-42e1-af57-a58c746af8a7",
                                                "sense_id": "1a1a5220-a2fa-31c4-a0f1-bd9ae3d18f9d",
                                                "text": "After the pandemic, MLG lost a lot of its viewership and profits which led it to close. The MLG Twitter account is no longer active and the mlg.com website directs to Battlenet instead of its old website."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5bf7a308-fd51-3665-852e-97734c5dd38e",
                                        "entry_id": "ba5bd138-66de-3752-b024-b25ff915f061",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Benefit, positive result obtained."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "dated",
                                            "literary",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b54873e0-e62e-4d87-9ab3-c155e47d8f6f",
                                                "sense_id": "5bf7a308-fd51-3665-852e-97734c5dd38e",
                                                "text": "Reading such an enlightening book on the subject was of much profit to his studies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3b5b52c-208f-464a-b5c1-03cd59157e93",
                                                "sense_id": "5bf7a308-fd51-3665-852e-97734c5dd38e",
                                                "text": "This I speak for your own profit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb838fcf-3e27-41cc-9db0-e13eafd109a5",
                                                "sense_id": "5bf7a308-fd51-3665-852e-97734c5dd38e",
                                                "text": "if you dare do yourself a profit and a right"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c02845ea-1127-3eb2-811c-171c6dba097a",
                                        "entry_id": "ba5bd138-66de-3752-b024-b25ff915f061",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ellipsis of profit à prendre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "countable",
                                            "ellipsis",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "profit",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d126d7b6-3d1b-39e8-8919-6f2b09b43db5",
                                        "entry_id": "0cf8c125-a520-3d10-8c9d-b7662a10bb12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To benefit (somebody), be of use to (somebody)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4ef5d61-719a-4933-b410-336703efaf2a",
                                                "sense_id": "d126d7b6-3d1b-39e8-8919-6f2b09b43db5",
                                                "text": "The word preached did not profit them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ebb371d-d8f8-453a-9150-3c954ba59e7c",
                                                "sense_id": "d126d7b6-3d1b-39e8-8919-6f2b09b43db5",
                                                "text": "It is a great means of profiting yourself, to copy diligently those excellent pieces and beautiful designs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc9fd599-1a7b-3ec2-9fe2-46e9f46bd642",
                                        "entry_id": "0cf8c125-a520-3d10-8c9d-b7662a10bb12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To benefit, gain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5b1156f-663a-3d8b-8df5-383b891bf5ba",
                                        "entry_id": "0cf8c125-a520-3d10-8c9d-b7662a10bb12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To take advantage of, exploit, use."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "882eaba4-8285-4118-9c89-c57b3ff207be",
                        "source_entry_id": "811516e9-7724-385d-ace9-12bbac653dd3",
                        "source_sense_id": "e8590ede-f9c9-3d39-9427-ce07efb07508",
                        "target_lang_word": "income",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "income",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c6392353-d7a8-3d7a-8433-0760c79d8f01",
                                        "entry_id": "bbc6afbf-918e-3d9f-970c-393f2748e7b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Money one earns by working or by capitalising on the work of others."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bcee2dd-1d46-4240-a350-5579178a9518",
                                                "sense_id": "c6392353-d7a8-3d7a-8433-0760c79d8f01",
                                                "text": "The struggle with ways and means had recommenced, more difficult now a hundredfold than it had been before, because of their increasing needs. Their income disappeared as a little rivulet that is swallowed by the thirsty ground."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98cd976e-2441-437a-b20c-4e377dfec85e",
                                                "sense_id": "c6392353-d7a8-3d7a-8433-0760c79d8f01",
                                                "text": "In 1970 the richest 1 percent made 9 percent of the nation’s income; now that top slice makes closer to 25 percent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0e38ba9-5c0a-484c-a421-2c74fc9d1440",
                                                "sense_id": "c6392353-d7a8-3d7a-8433-0760c79d8f01",
                                                "text": "It is the starving of the public sector which has been pivotal in America no longer being the land of opportunity – with a child's life prospects more dependent on the income and education of its parents than in other advanced countries."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9831ea5-92b1-38c8-be7f-47cb6980b138",
                                        "entry_id": "bbc6afbf-918e-3d9f-970c-393f2748e7b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Money coming in to a fund, account, or policy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88be139b-a8dc-3df8-9e40-86612a3106f1",
                                        "entry_id": "bbc6afbf-918e-3d9f-970c-393f2748e7b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A coming in; arrival; entrance; introduction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b65c567-c035-4dc3-bcdb-2cf329025129",
                                                "sense_id": "88be139b-a8dc-3df8-9e40-86612a3106f1",
                                                "text": "more abundant incomes of light and strength from God"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa103709-1bfe-4a6f-a837-6bf8460416da",
                                                "sense_id": "88be139b-a8dc-3df8-9e40-86612a3106f1",
                                                "text": "Pain payes the income of ech precious thing,"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6894ccae-c49b-3533-8eb7-fa142d38cc88",
                                        "entry_id": "bbc6afbf-918e-3d9f-970c-393f2748e7b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A newcomer or arrival; an incomer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Scotland",
                                            "archaic",
                                            "countable",
                                            "dialectal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd314d2f-ee35-3571-9a4c-5c99668a7832",
                                        "entry_id": "bbc6afbf-918e-3d9f-970c-393f2748e7b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An entrance-fee."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d11f3e1-18a6-300f-83c1-098fb2f9c381",
                                        "entry_id": "bbc6afbf-918e-3d9f-970c-393f2748e7b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A coming in as by influx or inspiration, hence, an inspired quality or characteristic, as courage or zeal; an inflowing principle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "284099ee-a836-4cc6-8050-92945684230b",
                                                "sense_id": "6d11f3e1-18a6-300f-83c1-098fb2f9c381",
                                                "text": "I would then make in indeed and steep / My income in their bloods."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2b4c63bf-ebd9-343f-b297-ed0c9fb4b4c1",
                                        "entry_id": "bbc6afbf-918e-3d9f-970c-393f2748e7b7",
                                        "glosses": [
